@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@contactId = REEMPLAZA_CON_CONTACT_ID

### Listar contactos
# Expected: 200 and items with contact data and related-record counts.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts?limit=100

### Eliminar permanentemente un contacto
# WARNING: This deletes the contact, messages, conversations, inquiries,
# notifications, appointments, and releases related appointment capacity.
# Expected: 200 only after remote items/conversations and local records are deleted.
# OpenAI 404 is tolerated; another remote error returns 500 and preserves local data.
# Retry the DELETE after correcting connectivity/credentials.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts/{{contactId}}

### Verificar que ya no existe
# Expected: the deleted contact no longer appears in the list.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contacts?limit=100
